    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Box&nbsp;2.08</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Hereditary gastric and breast cancer syndrome genetic testing criteria </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{32758476}</span></span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted, with permission, from: Blair VR, McLeod M, Carneiro F, et al. Hereditary diffuse gastric cancer: updated clinical practice guidelines. Lancet Oncol. 2020;21(8):e386&ndash;e397. PMID:32758476",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 492.65pt; background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"657\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 656px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"657\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Family criteria:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">1.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&ge;&nbsp;2 cases of gastric cancer in a family regardless of age, with at least one DGC</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">2.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&ge;&nbsp;1 cases of DGC at any age, and &ge;&nbsp;1 cases of LBC at age &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years, in different family members</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">3.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&ge;&nbsp;2 cases of LBC in family members, both diagnosed at age &lt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 656px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"657\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Individual criteria:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">1.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Isolated case of DGC at age &lt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">2.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">DGC at any age in individuals of Māori ethnicity</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">3.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">DGC at any age in individuals with a personal or family history (first-degree relative) of cleft lip or cleft palate</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">4.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">History of DGC and LBC, both diagnosed at age &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">5.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Bilateral LBC, diagnosed at age &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">6.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 640px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"619\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Gastric in&nbsp;situ signet-ring cells or pagetoid spread of signet-ring cells diagnosed at age &lt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">DGC, diffuse gastric cancer; LBC, lobular breast cancer.</span></p>",
